      "title": "Release v0.7.0",
      "summary": "These highlights are also published at flashinfer.ai/releases . v0.7.0 Highlights FlashInfer 0.7.0 makes the unified mixture-of-experts (MoE) API official, brings TRT-LLM Gen MoE kernels into readable Python source with PrimTS, and introduces Autotuner v2 and a formal experimental-API policy. It also expands sparse and linear attention, expert-parallel serving, and diffusion workloads across Blackwell GPUs. Read the v0.7 overview and the accompanying deep dives on MegaMoE , Autotuner v2 , and the experimental path ",
